OL,3,GNEWSAFlood-hit village set for #600k
OL,4,Adrainage upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #600,000 is needed to improve
OL,7,Fa village's flood protection due to its
OL,8,Fcurrent drainage system being
OL,9,F"ineffective", according to council
OL,10,Fofficials.
OL,12,FOfficers at Lincolnshire County Council
OL,13,Fsaid they want to award a contract to
OL,14,Fupgrade the drainage in Aslackby,
OL,15,Fbetween Sleaford and Bourne, along
OL,16,FTemple Road, Kirkby Underwood Road and
OL,17,FAveland Road.
OL,19,FA decision will be made by executive
OL,20,Fcouncillors about the plans at the end
OL,21,Fof September.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
