OL,3,GNEWSAFlood-hit village set for #600k
OL,4,Adrainage upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNathan Whitfield, principal design
OL,7,Fengineer for drainage, told a meeting
OL,8,Fon Monday: "The existing system will
OL,9,Fcontinue to deteriorate, increasing the
OL,10,Frisk of collapse leading to an increase
OL,11,Fin flood risk."
